==Battleground==
*7 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*5 [[Devil Wife|Devil Wives]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Baki Hanma (Enemy)|Baki Hanma]] spawns as the boss after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage isn't too hard. The Aku Doges are weak and die easily, while Devil Wife gives you a consistant cash boost. Chip Baki down with rushers or backliners and you'll win easily.

If you're looking to farm Legendary Dumbells, you can use [[Jelly Dumpling Cat]] to kill the first Aku Doge, which also kills Devil Wife. Send out [[Awakened Bahamut Cat]] and other rushers and you'll beat up the base before Baki spawns.

